<title>USA: USA Detergents speeds up facility opening.</title>
<headline>USA Detergents speeds up facility opening.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH BRUNSWICK, N.J. 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>USA Detergents Inc said on Friday it is accelerating the start-up of its new facility in Harrisonville, Mo., expecting it to be operational in the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>The company said the distribution and liquid- and powder-filling facility will help it meet growing demand in both domestic and export markets.</p>
